  "details": "Hi,I still have a problem too. I'm experiencing an issue where after staying in the world for more than 3 hour, my avatar lags for other people, and I have to rejoin consistently. I've tried uploading my avatar to another account using a different PC, and for the past 2 days, there has been no lag. This problem occurs only on my main rig, regardless of the avatars I use. If I stay for 6 hours or more without rejoining, no one can see my chatbox, hear my voice, and my avatar runs at 5 fps. I've had this problem for a long time but haven't been able to fix it.\n\nCPU: i7-13700KF\n\nMB: CVN Z690 GAMING FROZEN V21\n\nRAM: 32 gb ddr4 3200mhz\n\nGPU: iGame GeForce RTX 4090 Vulcan OC\n\nPV:https://drive.google.com/file/d/11ivfOxnwc_C1h4UcZ2ARs6tkeNPNxdYl/view?usp=sharing",
